# n8nac state files. The tsconfig.json rule is scoped to the generated ones under
# workflows/: it used to be unscoped, which also swallowed the Worker's own
# tsconfig.json at the repo root and left a fresh clone unable to typecheck.
.n8n-state.json
n8n-workflows.d.ts
workflows/**/tsconfig.json
.gstack/
